            "review_title": "Review at Moon Light House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "GARY R\nHoi An, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nHoi An Moon Hotel dinner\nSep 2026 • Couples\nAbsolutely wonderful food and friendly service from Hana who served your every need with grace and a wonderful smile.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026\nHoi An Moon Premium Boutique Hotel & Spa\nDear G9530BJgaryr,\n\nThank you so much for your lovely words! We’re delighted you enjoyed your dinner at Hoi An Moon, and we’re especially happy Hana made your evening memorable with her warm service and wonderful smile. We’ll be sure to share your kind words with her. We look forward to welcoming you back for another lovely dining experience!\n\nWarmest regard,\n\nVicky Nguyen \nGeneral Manager\nE-mail: gm@hoianmoon.com\nTel: +84 905 862 008\nHOI AN MOON PREMIUM BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nRead more\nWritten October 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
