            "review_title": "Review at Moon Light House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tegan M\n1 contribution\n0\nWonderful food and fantastic service\nSep 2026 • Family\nWe had a wonderful meal at the hotel restaurant. The food was delicious, beautifully presented and the service was fantastic. The staff were so friendly and attentive. We really enjoyed it!\nWritten September 30, 2026\nHoi An Moon Premium Boutique Hotel & Spa\nDear teganm865,\n\nThank you for sharing such a lovely review. I’m delighted to know that you enjoyed your meal with us, from the beautifully presented dishes to the warm and attentive service from our team.\nIt’s wonderful to hear that you truly enjoyed the experience at our restaurant. Your kind words mean a lot to the whole team, and we hope to create another memorable dining moment for you at Hoi An Moon.\n\nWarmest regard,\n\nVicky Nguyen \nGeneral Manager\nE-mail: gm@hoianmoon.com\nTel: +84 905 862 008\nHOI AN MOON PREMIUM BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
