            "review_title": "Review at Moon Light House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Boris B\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent\nSep 2026 • Family\nIt was excellent Vietnamese culinary experience with high quality cocktails from a Bum a barmen and great 5 stars service from Hellen !!\nHighly recommended.\nWritten September 28, 2026\nHoi An Moon Premium Boutique Hotel & Spa\nDear 961borisb,\n\nThank you very much for sharing your experience with us. We’re delighted that you enjoyed the Vietnamese cuisine, quality cocktails from our bartender Bum, and Helen’s attentive service.\nYour kind words are a wonderful encouragement to the team. We hope to welcome you back to stay at Hoi An Moon and enjoy another memorable dining experience at Moonlight House — making your next Hoi An getaway even more complete and enjoyable.\n\nWarmest regard,\n\nVicky Nguyen \nGeneral Manager\nE-mail: gm@hoianmoon.com\nTel: +84 905 862 008\nHOI AN MOON PREMIUM BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
