            "review_title": "Review at Moon Light House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "John W\n2 contributions\n0\nPerfect Way to Start the Day\nSep 2026 • Family\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nFantastic breakfast experience at Hoi An Moon! Everything was fresh, delicious, and beautifully presented. There was a great variety of both Vietnamese and Western options, and the quality was excellent. The staff were warm, attentive, and genuinely welcoming, which made the morning even better. The atmosphere was relaxed and comfortable, and it was a perfect way to start the day in Hoi An. Highly recommend!\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2026\nWanderer54546081783\nDear P741FDjohnw,\n\nThank you for sharing such a lovely breakfast experience with us. 🌙\nI’m especially happy to know that you enjoyed the freshness and quality of our dishes, as well as the variety of both Vietnamese and Western choices. We put a lot of care into presenting breakfast not simply as a meal, but as a chance for our guests to discover different flavours — especially a little taste of Vietnam while enjoying their familiar favourites.\nHearing that the beautiful presentation, relaxed atmosphere and warm care from our team made breakfast the perfect way to start your day in Hoi An means so much to us.\nI hope those delicious mornings at Hoi An Moon remain among your favourite memories of your time here. 💛\n\nWarmest regards,\n\nVicky Nguyen \nGeneral Manager\nE-mail: gm@hoianmoon.com\nTel: +84 905 862 008\nHOI AN MOON PREMIUM BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
