            "review_text": "ajsteinberg\nMalibu, California51 contributions\n0\nExceptional food and service!\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWhat a wonderful meal! Usually we don’t expect much from a hotel’s restaurant, but the Moon Light Restaurant at the Hoi An Moon Hotel was exceptional! We arrived late in Hoi An and were too tired to go out to eat, and we were so happy that we had the chance to relax and enjoy the amazing food and hospitality of this restaurant! A special thank you to Helen for her warm welcome and excellent service.\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2026\nWanderer54546081783\nDear ajsteinberg,\nThank you so much for your heartfelt review. 🌙\nWe’re especially happy to know that after arriving late in Hoi An and feeling too tired to go out, you could simply relax and enjoy a wonderful meal at Moonlight. Creating those comfortable, unhurried moments for our guests means a lot to us.\nAnd thank you for mentioning Helen so warmly. I’ll be sure to share your kind words with her — I know they will make her day!\nWe hope to welcome you back to Moonlight for another lovely evening when you return to Hoi An. 🌙\n\nWarmest regards,\n\nVicky Nguyen \nGeneral Manager\nE-mail: gm@hoianmoon.com\nTel: +84 905 862 008\nHOI AN MOON PREMIUM BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
